contain, fork, or reimplement yt-dlp, YouTube, or Mullvad VPN.

Third-party tools
-----------------

yt-dlp

- Project: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
- License: Unlicense
- Use in this repository: downloaded by the local operator through
  `legends-yt-dlp yt-dlp install`, verified against upstream SHA2-256SUMS, and executed
  as an external child process.
- Distribution note: this source repository and alpha package do not bundle the
  yt-dlp executable. If a future package bundles yt-dlp, include the upstream
  license text and any current upstream notices in that package.

Mullvad VPN

- Product: https://mullvad.net
- App source: https://github.com/mullvad/mullvadvpn-app
- App license: GPL-3.0
- Use in this repository: controls the official Mullvad CLI installed by the
  user's local Mullvad VPN app.
- Distribution note: this project does not bundle Mullvad VPN, Mullvad CLI, or
  Mullvad assets. Users install and license Mullvad separately.

NVIDIA NeMo

- Project: https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo
- License: Apache-2.0 for the open-source toolkit.
- Use in this repository: optional external ASR runtime for future
  post-capture transcription workflows.
- Distribution note: this project does not bundle NeMo, PyTorch, CUDA, or any
  NeMo container image.

NVIDIA Parakeet ASR models

- Parakeet v2: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2
- Parakeet v3: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
- Model license: CC BY 4.0 according to the public model cards.
- Use in this repository: recommended optional ASR model family for producing
  timestamped word ledgers.
- Distribution note: this project does not bundle Parakeet model weights. Users
  download and use the models under their own accepted model terms.

CrispASR and Parakeet GGUF

- CrispASR project: https://github.com/CrispStrobe/CrispASR
- CrispASR license: MIT according to the repository.
- Parakeet GGUF model files:
  https://huggingface.co/cstr/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-GGUF
- Model license: CC BY 4.0 inherited from NVIDIA Parakeet according to the
  model card.
- Use in this repository: preferred ready-made local ASR backend for producing
  timestamped word ledgers.
- Distribution note: this project does not bundle CrispASR binaries or GGUF
  model files. Users install them separately and comply with their licenses.

FFmpeg

- Project: https://ffmpeg.org
- License note: FFmpeg build licensing depends on the exact build and enabled
